  python  apilevel, paramstyle, threadsafety, version: DB-API's descriptions of itself; the placeholder is in the module's comment, and a connection crosses no thread
  python  Connection.cursor, Cursor, Cursor.close, Cursor.connection, Cursor.setoutputsize, Cursor.noscan: DB-API's cursor, a second handle over the connection, and its plumbing; every call here answers whole, and `{escape}` sequences reach the driver as written
